          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Ensure smooth interaction with other systems and processes</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Rely on a dedicated project manager, who works with you to understand your entire operation, configure interfaces, educate users and make your new solution a time-saving, trusted part of their work.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">For your ePCR, automate or streamline data interfaces with CAD, billing, and third-party agency systems, defibrillation devices, organizational recordkeeping and regulatory agencies.</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
