          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Develop team confidence and competence faster</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Follow easy, step-by-step implementation processes and critical-path timelines.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Take advantage of proven procedures and tools that can be tailored to your situation.<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Use our train-the-trainer approach to develop internal experts and provide comprehensive education to super-users, managers and anyone who enters data.<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Make the most of your investment with a well-planned, prompt and complete implementation by our experienced team using standard project management methodology.<br>\n </span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Apr 23 2024 13:24:01 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
